OL,3,A'The reason we lost is the war,' JD
OL,4,AVance says after Democrats take control
OL,5,Aof Congress
OL,6,
OL,7,FElsewhere, speaking at the White House
OL,8,Fballroom construction site, Trump says
OL,9,Fhis administration has made the US
OL,10,Fcapital "beautiful" - without initially
OL,11,Fmentioning the midterms
OL,13,FTo reporters after, he says he will
OL,14,F"get along, probably, with the
OL,15,FDemocrats unless they want to be
OL,16,Fdestructive"
OL,18,FIn Senate races, Democrats picked up a
OL,19,Fstring of victories in Republican
OL,20,Fstrongholds including Texas, South
OL,21,FCarolina and Kansas
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
